# The pink horizon after looking up (the user, 2026-11-14, a screenshot at 0020 facing north: the
# sky's pink band shows below the city's skyline once you let go of looking up). Booted on 0020
# (facing back east), a quarter turn left to face north, then Y held to look up, let go, and shots
# as the view comes back down and after it's level
boot_at 0020
wait_up
wait 1.0
hold left 0.6
wait 1.0
shot lu_00_level
keydown y
wait 1.0
shot lu_01_up
keyup y
wait 0.15
shot lu_02_coming_down
wait 0.15
shot lu_03
wait 0.3
shot lu_04
wait 1.0
shot lu_05_level_again
wait 2.0
shot lu_06_later
